> Is it correct that M value correspond to Log2(Signal in Cy5) -  
> Log2(Signal in Cy3)?

yes.

> So in fact my question is how to transform the M value, in over  
> expressed value ?

Just do some basic math:

   M  =  log2(Cy5) - log2(Cy3)
   M  =  log2( Cy5/Cy3 )
 2^M  =  Cy5/Cy3

