>> keeping the names unique:
>>    > unlist(list(AA=letters[1:3], AA2="bb"))
>>     AA1  AA2  AA3  AA2
>>     "a"  "b"  "c" "bb"
>> So mangling the names doesn't solve anything but just adds confusion.
