From mcarlson at fhcrc.org  Fri Oct 24 18:52:43 2008
From: mcarlson at fhcrc.org (Marc Carlson)
Date: Fri, 24 Oct 2008 09:52:43 -0700
Subject: [BioC] GOstats: Listing genes from hyperGTest
In-Reply-To: <4901D124.5010209@med.umich.edu>
References: <796991.62756.qm@web58008.mail.re3.yahoo.com>
